<speak>The habit usually matters more than the stationery, although a folder you like can make it easier to start. Keep the structure simple enough that you can use it on a busy day. You mentioned a walk with your daughter later; hopefully the weather cooperates. If not, perhaps your indoor backup plan can come in handy. Before we say goodbye, is there any general appointment or document-navigation question left on your administrative sheet? You don't need to read any personal or transaction details again.</speak>